    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1271">

                <pb facs="0878" n="762" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg762"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/8924.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Miller to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tampico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-09-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 18, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Private information not confirmed indicates Mexican Government gathering
                    information for the purpose of compelling foreign corporations as well as native
                    corporations to make forced loans to Mexican Government in the form of purchase
                    of bonds to relieve Government’s financial condition.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Miller</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
